   "source": [
    "### Project Scope\n",
    "\n",
    "This project focuses on predicting Type 2 Diabetes risk using self-reported BRFSS survey data. It is intended as a clinical decision-support tool and not as a replacement for professional medical diagnosis. Predictions generated by the model should complement healthcare assessments rather than serve as definitive diagnoses.\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
