    "\n",
    "Following variable selection, a separate working dataset was created containing only the variables required for Type 2 diabetes prediction. Working with a reduced dataset minimizes memory usage, simplifies subsequent preprocessing steps, and improves computational efficiency without sacrificing information relevant to the study.\n",
