    "## 5.2 Train / Test Split\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset is partitioned into a training set and a held-out test set before\n",
    "any fitting operations  including imputation and scaling  are applied. This\n",
    "ordering is critical for preventing **data leakage**, where information from\n",
    "the test set inadvertently influences the preprocessing steps and produces\n",
    "overly optimistic evaluation metrics.\n",
    "\n",
    "A **80/20 split** is applied with stratification on the target variable to\n",
    "preserve the 6.2:1 class balance across both sets. A fixed random state\n",
    "ensures reproducibility."
