    "the model to over-correct toward the majority class during evaluation.\n",
    "Revisiting this configuration either removing `scale_pos_weight` when\n",
    "SMOTE has already been applied, or tuning the decision threshold is strongly\n",
    "recommended before discarding XGBoost as a candidate.\n",
