    "XGBoost, LightGBM, and CatBoost all achieve high accuracy and precision\n",
    "while producing unacceptably low recall. This is a direct consequence of\n",
    "the interaction between SMOTE oversampling on the training set and the\n",
    "additional class weight parameters passed to each model both mechanisms\n",
    "address imbalance independently, and combining them distorts the decision\n",
    "boundary toward the majority class at inference time.\n",
    "\n",
    "CatBoost does not advance as the final model in its current configuration."
   ]
