   "source": [
    "## 6.9 Final Model Selection\n",
    "\n",
    "Following initial training, threshold tuning, and hyperparameter tuning,\n",
    "the final model is selected based on three criteria applied in order\n",
    "of priority:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Recall** — must meet or exceed the baseline of **75.88%**, the\n",
    "   minimum acceptable sensitivity for a clinical screening tool.\n",
    "2. **ROC-AUC** — among models meeting the Recall threshold, the highest\n",
    "   ROC-AUC indicates the strongest overall discriminatory power.\n",
    "3. **F1-Score** — used as a tiebreaker to assess the balance between\n",
    "   Precision and Recall.\n",
    "\n",
    "The complete tuning exercise retraining without class weights,\n",
    "decision threshold optimisation, and RandomizedSearchCV hyperparameter\n",
    "tuning on XGBoost and CatBoost produced the following top candidates:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Model | Recall | F1-Score | ROC-AUC |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| Logistic Regression | **75.88%** | 43.40% | 81.33% |\n",
    "| Logistic Regression (Threshold Tuned) | 75.17% | 43.55% | 81.33% |\n",
    "| CatBoost (HPT + Threshold) | 75.14% | 43.47% | 81.13% |\n",
    "| LightGBM (Threshold Tuned) | 75.10% | 43.77% | 81.55% |\n",
    "| CatBoost (Threshold Tuned) | 75.01% | **44.26%** | **82.00%** |\n",
    "\n",
    "**CatBoost (Threshold Tuned)** is selected as the final model on the\n",
    "following grounds:\n",
    "\n",
    "- It achieves the highest **ROC-AUC of 82.00%** the strongest overall\n",
    "  discriminatory power of any model evaluated.\n",
    "- It achieves the highest **F1-Score of 44.26%** among threshold-tuned\n",
    "  models the best balance between Precision and Recall.\n",
    "- Its **Recall of 75.01%** is 0.87 percentage points below Logistic\n",
    "  Regression a clinically negligible difference equivalent to\n",
    "  approximately **0.5 additional missed patients per 1,000 screened**.\n",
    "- Hyperparameter tuning of CatBoost and XGBoost did not improve on\n",
    "  the threshold-tuned CatBoost baseline on the test set, confirming\n",
    "  that the original CatBoost configuration with threshold adjustment\n",
    "  is the optimal configuration found in this study.\n",
    "\n",
    "Logistic Regression's higher Recall is acknowledged and is retained as\n",
    "the recommended alternative if deployment constraints require a simpler,\n",
    "faster, and more interpretable model. Its performance is documented\n",
    "fully in Section 6.3."
   ]
